# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) for local dev. Never commit .env.local.
#
# Env var names are locked by the tech note (P1-F02-T03, docs/tech/). The
# client only ever reads tiles/glyphs/sprite URLs from these three: it never
# hardcodes a basemap host, so the real Bangkok tile host (Cloudflare
# R2/Pages, D-008) drops in later without a code change.
#
# All three are EMPTY here on purpose (tech-lead D-044, P1-H01). The value
# this file used to carry (https://build.protomaps.com/20230925.pmtiles) is a
# Protomaps Basemap **schema v3** build, but art/direction/map-style/kw-light
# style.json (P1-F03-T12) is written for **schema v4** — layer names and
# `kind` values do not match, so the map would draw incorrectly with no
# error. An unset VITE_TILES_URL makes the client show its honest "not
# configured" state instead (src/env.ts, src/main.ts), which is safer than a
# silently wrong map. Pick ONE option below (uncomment its three lines) and
# put it in .env.local, never here.
#
# (a) P1-F02-T06's committed Lumpini Park fixture (preferred: offline, no
#     external host, works in CI). First run, in another shell:
#       python3 tools/tiles/bin/serve.py   # http://127.0.0.1:8765/, root = tools/tiles/
#     then either scheme (tools/tiles/README.md section 5, `set-public-url.sh`
#     already points the fixture's tiles.json at this same server):
# VITE_TILES_URL=pmtiles://http://127.0.0.1:8765/fixtures/lumpini/pmtiles/pm4-20260923-z15-lumpini.pmtiles
# VITE_GLYPHS_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8765/fixtures/lumpini/glyphs/{fontstack}/{range}.pbf
# VITE_SPRITE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8765/fixtures/lumpini/sprites/v4/light
#
# (b) Before P1-F02-T06, dev only — a public Protomaps daily build (schema
#     v4; do not pin a date in this repo, the bucket only keeps ~62 builds):
# VITE_TILES_URL=https://build.protomaps.com/<YYYYMMDD>.pmtiles
# VITE_GLYPHS_URL=https://protomaps.github.io/basemaps-assets/fonts/{fontstack}/{range}.pbf
# VITE_SPRITE_URL=https://protomaps.github.io/basemaps-assets/sprites/v4/light
VITE_TILES_URL=
VITE_GLYPHS_URL=
VITE_SPRITE_URL=
